---
---

<section class="hero-container">
  <div class="hero-headline">
    <span class="position-badge">Tech Lead • Head of Software Automation</span>
    <h1>Scaling quality engineering infrastructure & autonomous test platforms.</h1>
    <p class="hero-bio">
      Leading end-to-end software quality strategy, building zero-flakiness test architectures from scratch, and aligning engineering outcomes directly with executive leadership.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Executive Impact Strip -->
  <div class="impact-strip glass-card">
    <div class="impact-item">
      <span class="impact-value">88%</span>
      <span class="impact-label">Cycle Time Reduction</span>
    </div>
    <div class="impact-divider"></div>
    <div class="impact-item">
      <span class="impact-value">12+</span>
      <span class="impact-label">Squads Aligned</span>
    </div>
    <div class="impact-divider"></div>
    <div class="impact-item">
      <span class="impact-value">0-to-1</span>
      <span class="impact-label">Platforms Built</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Competency Pillars -->
  <div class="pillars-grid">
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <h3>Strategic Leadership</h3>
      <p>Team scaling, quality strategy, cross-functional alignment, and engineering mentorship.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <h3>Platform & Infrastructure</h3>
      <p>From-scratch autonomous execution engines, CI/CD orchestration, and dynamic parallel scheduling.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <h3>Quality Engineering</h3>
      <p>Performance, API, E2E automation, deterministic state management, and chaos testing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding: 3rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .position-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .hero-headline h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .hero-bio {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.85;
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .impact-strip {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--surface-border-accent);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .impact-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .impact-value {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .impact-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .impact-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 30px;
    background: var(--surface-border);
  }
  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .pillar-card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }
  .pillar-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .pillar-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  }
</style>